  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Storms — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>You are born with an amazing power, with many possibilities, storm creation to ride the breeze.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level, you have learned the basics of storm generation and can launch a wave of cutting winds from your hands as well as the ability to cast <em>Gust</em>. As a bonus action for 1 Cursed Energy, you unleash a 15-foot cone which forces targets in range to make a Dexterity save. On a failure, they take 2d8 slashing or thunder (your choice) damage or half as much damage on a success. Your damage dice increases to 3d8 at 5th level, 4d8 at 11th level, and 5d8 at 17th level.</p>",
